        Two-week close realism
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">
        A two-week closing can happen, but only when the file is ready.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        We would rather tell you the real timeline than promise a magic date. If
        the house has clear title, known payoffs, available signers, and a
        realistic possession plan, a fast cash closing becomes much more
